Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.87,0:00:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.95,0:00:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These words lured men to\Nthe Grand Line in pursuit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.31,0:00:26.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dared to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.49,0:00:29.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.11,0:00:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.87,0:00:40.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.73,0:00:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.47,0:00:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compass left behind,\Nit'll only slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.65,0:00:58.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your heart will be your guide,\Nraise the sails and take the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.57,0:01:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That legendary place that\Nthe end of the map reveals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.99,0:01:10.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is only legendary till\Nsomeone proves it real?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.21,0:01:14.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it all, through\Nall the trouble and times.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.57,0:01:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the heartache\Nand through the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.91,0:01:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that I will be there to stand by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.17,0:01:24.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I know you'll stand by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.37,0:01:28.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come aboard and bring along.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.33,0:01:30.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.43,0:01:33.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.97,0:01:35.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.15,0:01:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's always room for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.79,0:01:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wanna be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.13,0:01:46.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are, we are on a cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.37,0:01:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.07,0:01:53.24,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(978,0)\3c&H1E1E1E&\c&H1E1E1E&\bord2.3\1a&HFF&\t(936,978,\1a&H00&)}Spin, Pinwheel, Spin
Dialogue: 2,0:01:50.07,0:01:53.24,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(978,0)\c&HE7E6E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&}Spin, Pinwheel, Spin
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.89,0:01:54.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Bro won!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.03,0:01:57.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got Barker's fallen!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.65,0:02:06.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nojiko, is all of this really happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.53,0:02:08.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely this is a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.95,0:02:22.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good job, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.09,0:02:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You almost did as good as me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.57,0:02:26.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's face it, I'm pretty much the star,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.41,0:02:28.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'll cheer for you\Nanyway because I'm super
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.17,0:02:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,modest and I don't want\Nto steal your thunder!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.71,0:02:33.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really had us going there, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.49,0:02:36.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Start dealing with the bad guys quicker.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.55,0:02:37.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I almost had a heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.89,0:02:39.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You rubber jerk
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.21,0:03:09.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.33,0:03:25.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, hold it right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.81,0:03:27.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, it's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.41,0:03:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a lucky day today is!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.01,0:03:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very nice, I saw the entire\Nfight and I must say good work!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.55,0:03:39.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can only assume that your victory\Nhere was some sort of bizarre accident I
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.09,0:03:43.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,never thought the fishman would lose to\Nriff-raff like you and your crew However,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.39,0:03:45.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now that our long is out of the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.47,0:03:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be taking all the money I\Nwas supposed to give to him in
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.81,0:03:52.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,addition to all the treasure and\Nall on park now drop your weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.87,0:03:56.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Colonel News me of branch\N16 gets all the credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.89,0:04:04.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trying to rain these people's\Nparade now that's just plain?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.75,0:04:12.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You scum. Just try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.17,0:04:13.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll be sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.41,0:04:14.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.17,0:04:16.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's still talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.11,0:04:22.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is for shooting Nojiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.63,0:04:27.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And also for mercilessly destroying\NBellomere's Tangerine Orchard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.85,0:04:31.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.93,0:04:37.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.13,0:04:39.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That felt good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.67,0:04:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A thousand more and we'll call it even!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.03,0:04:51.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you're gonna do is\Nclean up after those fishmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.29,0:04:53.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you're gonna help to\Nrebuild the town of Gosa,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.91,0:04:57.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you won't lay a finger on any of\Nthe money or valuables in Arlong Park.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.91,0:05:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the island's money now. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.25,0:05:01.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.23,0:05:04.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't really think you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.45,0:05:06.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.11,0:05:08.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me my money back, jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.63,0:05:10.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.85,0:05:12.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give every berry back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.55,0:05:18.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get you, you pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.09,0:05:20.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy is your captain, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.41,0:05:24.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, mark my frigging words, Brook!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.09,0:05:26.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Major things are gonna happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.67,0:05:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because you made me angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.39,0:05:30.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear you'll regret this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.67,0:05:33.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get my revenge just to wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.53,0:05:36.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Major things are going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.63,0:05:39.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, how does he know I'm\Ngoing to be king of the pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.95,0:05:41.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not what he means at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.89,0:05:43.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you really that dumb?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.13,0:05:44.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, what next?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.37,0:05:46.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we in super big trouble or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.65,0:05:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.79,0:05:52.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, everyone, now's not the\Ntime to keep this to ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.71,0:05:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to tell everyone on the\Nisland what happened here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.67,0:05:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.21,0:06:02.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Island Park has fallen!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.39,0:06:04.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.89,0:06:06.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that on your chest? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.93,0:06:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Made you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.84,0:06:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you joking?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.91,0:06:18.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good job, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.29,0:06:24.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To think our island would\Nbe saved by unruly pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.29,0:06:26.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world is strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.05,0:06:46.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you still here, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.49,0:06:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your friends have been looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.91,0:06:54.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nojiko? Huh? Lorenzo,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.81,0:06:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Bellamy were still alive and\NI wanted to become a pirate,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.97,0:07:00.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do you think she'd let me do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.09,0:07:01.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.37,0:07:03.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.63,0:07:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course she'd never\Nlet her precious daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.69,0:07:08.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,go out to sea with a bunch\Nof treacherous pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.43,0:07:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she'd let me do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.55,0:07:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if she had said no, that\Nwouldn't stop you, would it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.97,0:07:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, that's right. Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.17,0:07:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.29,0:07:25.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up, Genzo?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.59,0:07:30.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You certainly are Bellamy's kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.91,0:07:32.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.41,0:07:36.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, you've already made\Nup your mind about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.61,0:07:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no use fighting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.71,0:07:41.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Live your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.23,0:07:48.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's still at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.33,0:07:52.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you saw the way he\Nlooked after that fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.17,0:07:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.41,0:07:56.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone else would have been dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.49,0:07:59.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.03,0:08:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you think this would heal on its own?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.01,0:08:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, pirates are supposed\Nto be smarter than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.67,0:08:10.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you have a ship, Doctor? Doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.11,0:08:12.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never thought of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.23,0:08:13.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good idea. Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.87,0:08:16.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we need to get a\Nmusician first, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.17,0:08:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.35,0:08:19.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because pirates really like to sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.89,0:08:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.80,0:08:23.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why is that first? Hello? Hello?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.38,0:08:27.84,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(976,980)\an2\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(934,976,\1a&H00&)\t(4480,4521,\1a&HFF&)}Marine Base (16th Branch)
Dialogue: 2,0:08:22.38,0:08:27.84,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(976,980)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\3c&HF9F9FA&\c&HF9F9FA&\1a&HFF&\t(934,976,\1a&H00&)\t(4480,4521,\1a&HFF&)\4a&HFF&}Marine Base (16th Branch)
Dialogue: 3,0:08:22.38,0:08:27.84,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(976,980)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&HF9F9FA&\4a&HFF&}Marine Base (16th Branch)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.45,0:08:27.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, this is Navy Headquarters.\NHeadquarters? Right. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.99,0:08:34.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, this is Colonel Nezumi of\NMarine Branch 16, Marine Code 00733.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:35.14,0:08:39.27,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(729,482)\an2\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(687,729,\1a&H00&)\t(3648,3690,\1a&HFF&)}Transponder Snail\N16th Marine Branch
Dialogue: 2,0:08:35.14,0:08:39.27,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(729,482)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\3c&HF9F9FA&\c&HF9F9FA&\1a&HFF&\t(687,729,\1a&H00&)\t(3648,3690,\1a&HFF&)\4a&HFF&}Transponder Snail\N16th Marine Branch
Dialogue: 3,0:08:35.14,0:08:39.27,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(729,482)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&HF9F9FA&\4a&HFF&}Transponder Snail\N16th Marine Branch
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.37,0:08:36.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a request.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.03,0:08:38.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There really is no reason to shout.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.99,0:08:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.90,0:08:42.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, there's a pirate\Nwho wears a Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.27,0:08:43.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's named Luffy.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:43.31,0:08:47.49,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(734,0)\an2\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(692,734,\1a&H00&)}Transponder Snail\NMarine HQ
Dialogue: 2,0:08:43.31,0:08:47.49,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(734,0)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\3c&HF9F9FA&\c&HF9F9FA&\1a&HFF&\t(692,734,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}Transponder Snail\NMarine HQ
Dialogue: 3,0:08:43.31,0:08:47.49,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(734,0)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&HF9F9FA&\4a&HFF&}Transponder Snail\NMarine HQ
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.57,0:08:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, there's a pirate\Nwho wears a Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.45,0:08:47.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's named Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.65,0:08:51.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hereby declare that he and his four crew\Nmembers are enemies of the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.83,0:08:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hereby declare that he and his four crew\Nmembers are enemies of the government!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:52.03,0:08:56.41,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(731,730)\an2\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(689,731,\1a&H00&)\t(3650,3692,\1a&HFF&)}Marine HQ Information Office
Dialogue: 2,0:08:52.03,0:08:56.41,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(731,730)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\3c&HF9F9FA&\c&HF9F9FA&\1a&HFF&\t(689,731,\1a&H00&)\t(3650,3692,\1a&HFF&)\4a&HFF&}Marine HQ Information Office
Dialogue: 3,0:08:52.03,0:08:56.41,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(731,730)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&HF9F9FA&\4a&HFF&}Marine HQ Information Office
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.81,0:08:58.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.59,0:09:00.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They managed to take down the purportedly
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.83,0:09:03.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,invincible fishman\NArlong at his home base!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.81,0:09:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Based on the grave threat they present,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.69,0:09:08.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a large bounty has been\Nplaced on their captain,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.27,0:09:09.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.95,0:09:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Transmitting photograph now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.91,0:09:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.83,0:09:17.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.74,0:09:20.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You couldn't have taken a\Nbetter picture than that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.15,0:09:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.06,0:09:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.37,0:09:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay. Right after a quick verification,\NI'll send it in for approval, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.53,0:09:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.44,0:09:31.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget! He's a wanted\Npirate, dead or alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.29,0:09:35.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want his face on posters\Nall over the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.73,0:09:51.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, am I stuffed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.87,0:09:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nice to not have\Nto cook for a change.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.77,0:09:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So how are you feeling, Zoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.81,0:09:57.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.95,0:10:00.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think all I need is\Na little bit of rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.11,0:10:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.65,0:10:04.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, how much longer\Ncan they keep this up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.09,0:10:06.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been three days now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.91,0:10:08.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing wrong with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.21,0:10:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smoke them if you got them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.43,0:10:15.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji! That melon you just had?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.53,0:10:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to give it a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.19,0:10:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It isn't polite to talk\Nwith your mouth full.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.49,0:10:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.40,0:10:22.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was raw ham melon with raw ham on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.11,0:10:24.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raw ham melon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.25,0:10:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me where you found us. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.51,0:10:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole town is\Nbasically one giant buffet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.69,0:10:31.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck finding it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.17,0:10:33.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He ran off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.27,0:10:38.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three days of stuffing his face,\Nso now that my belly is full,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.79,0:10:40.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time to dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.45,0:10:44.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Captain Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.03,0:10:48.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I destroyed the strongest\Nof all the fishmen!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.81,0:10:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's sing about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.81,0:10:53.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's sing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.19,0:10:57.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the greatest of friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.25,0:10:59.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm the best dad to see!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.75,0:11:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.51,0:11:03.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd be more upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.13,0:11:06.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't this happen\Nbefore my daddy died?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.41,0:11:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is life so unfair?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.59,0:11:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.33,0:11:12.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was kind of upset at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.89,0:11:15.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I decided just to\Nthink about my future.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.99,0:11:16.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.03,0:11:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were saved by the Straw\NHat guy and his friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.49,0:11:26.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But tomorrow we have to start all over\Nagain on our own without anybody's help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.53,0:11:28.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't forget the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.65,0:11:32.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now, it's really\Nup to us what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.93,0:11:35.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no one to blame\Nour problems on anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.27,0:11:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can succeed or fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.85,0:11:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It all depends on our choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.55,0:11:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whining about the past gets us nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.53,0:11:44.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I decided to think that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.87,0:11:50.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That so? Stop! Ow! Ow! My ghost!\NStop! That hurts! Ow! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.45,0:11:54.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no fun if I can't\Nharass you for being a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.31,0:11:57.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you decided to hurt me\Ninstead, you stupid old punk?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.03,0:12:05.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Punk, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.81,0:12:10.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you get rid of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.29,0:12:11.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.31,0:12:14.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you do realize this is a tattoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.27,0:12:17.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.95,0:12:19.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it wouldn't come off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.13,0:12:23.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want anyone to see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.45,0:12:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.36,0:12:28.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this awful tattoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.21,0:12:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just pretending, but\Nit's like he owns me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.81,0:12:36.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.81,0:12:41.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nojiko, what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.79,0:12:43.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.69,0:12:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.01,0:12:45.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a tattoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.31,0:12:49.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I look just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.03,0:12:56.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.73,0:13:00.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'd like a new tattoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.65,0:13:02.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.35,0:13:05.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at those two! Days!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.23,0:13:07.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Zoro, number 185!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.79,0:13:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's stand as we sing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.07,0:13:18.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bellamy, your daughters\Nare strong young women now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.51,0:13:19.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd be so proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.93,0:13:23.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like I'm standing\Nright in front of you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.31,0:13:26.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not going to waste\Na single moment now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.85,0:13:29.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So much has been lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.45,0:13:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone has had to make\Nterrible sacrifices.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.13,0:13:34.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which is why I don't care\Nif I look like a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.83,0:13:37.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm happy for the first\Ntime in a long while.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.57,0:13:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohanman!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.91,0:13:44.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No food out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.05,0:13:47.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go back. Be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.53,0:13:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.44,0:13:51.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did somebody die?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.19,0:13:53.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.69,0:13:56.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.47,0:13:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I give you to my conveniences.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.33,0:14:01.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With my sincere compliments.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.15,0:14:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, my darkest con -\NMy deepest condolences.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.47,0:14:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.63,0:14:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.54,0:14:11.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know Nami's going away with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.93,0:14:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She has her mind set on becoming a\Npirate, and that's dangerous business.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.35,0:14:17.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm fine with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.91,0:14:19.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.79,0:14:25.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if any of you ever do anything\Nto hurt her, I will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.31,0:14:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not gonna hurt her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.99,0:14:31.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.31,0:14:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure.
