Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.83,0:15:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.74,0:15:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up with all the food?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.21,0:15:13.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you two know what today is?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.49,0:15:18.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the anniversary of the day I met you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.23,0:15:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're celebrating the day\Nyou became my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.39,0:15:27.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.27,0:15:31.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a storm, so what\Nif it ruins our crops?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.53,0:15:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to learn to be strong girls\Nwho can smile even during hard times.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.31,0:15:39.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do that and nothing will ever stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.41,0:15:43.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now show me those smiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.87,0:15:46.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, will you go get the salt?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.69,0:15:50.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see you can draw land maps\Nnow as well as sea charts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.01,0:15:53.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted the book to study navigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.99,0:15:56.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Navigation as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.35,0:15:58.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to be a navigator?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.31,0:15:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.22,0:16:02.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to guide ships around\Nall the oceans of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.15,0:16:03.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.13,0:16:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'll be able to make maps of\Nall the far-off places I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.05,0:16:10.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, this island map is a first\Nstep toward realizing your dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.73,0:16:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.64,0:16:12.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.79,0:16:46.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Bellamy, we finally made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.07,0:16:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It took eight long years,\Nbut we're finally free.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.01,0:16:52.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The village and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.09,0:16:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just like you told\Nus when we were children.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.79,0:16:59.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be brave and smile and nothing\Nwill be able to stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.57,0:17:00.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.23,0:17:04.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arlong is gone, and now\Neverybody is so happy to be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.11,0:17:07.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.25,0:17:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm finally going to leave this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.05,0:17:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't worry. I'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.79,0:17:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going with good, strong people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.65,0:17:17.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.83,0:17:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this last map is\Nall that I have left to
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.97,0:17:25.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,remind me but none of that\Nreally matters anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.09,0:17:28.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, because now I'll\Nstart again and every
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.97,0:17:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,map I draw will be for me and nobody else!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.67,0:17:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh you see this time when I see the\Nworld it will be with all of my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.83,0:17:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know that's what I've always wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.39,0:17:45.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway I'm just trying to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.81,0:17:47.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because I don't know if I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.69,0:17:58.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going now, okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:18.76,0:18:22.02,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(483,0)\an2\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(441,483,\1a&H00&)}The Morning of Departure
