Dialogue: 3,0:18:18.76,0:18:22.02,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(483,0)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&HF9F9FA&\4a&HFF&}The Morning of Departure
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.87,0:18:26.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the last one, right? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.45,0:18:28.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got everything? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.73,0:18:32.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, we're stocked\Nup with everything we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.47,0:18:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we're good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.65,0:18:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, we've only been on this\Nlittle island for a few days,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.59,0:18:38.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it feels more like a lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.95,0:18:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.25,0:18:50.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't thank you enough for\Neverything you've done for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.55,0:18:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we gotta go back to our\Nregular jobs as bounty hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.15,0:18:55.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.91,0:18:58.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope we get to meet again someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.75,0:19:00.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.55,0:19:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.85,0:19:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, now it's time for us to get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.25,0:19:07.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we can't leave yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.07,0:19:09.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta wait for Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.37,0:19:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe she's not coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.13,0:19:13.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.39,0:19:16.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you tried to hit on her again, I\Nswear I'll break your freaking neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.77,0:19:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.68,0:19:18.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would I do something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.60,0:19:19.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She might not even be coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.07,0:19:21.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, she has achieved her goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.71,0:19:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami doesn't have to be a pirate anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.85,0:19:25.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She might be better off\Nif she stayed here on
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.57,0:19:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this island with all\Nher friends and family.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.75,0:19:28.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about me, damn it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.07,0:19:30.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without Nami on board,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.89,0:19:35.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have like 98.72 % less reason to stay\Nwith you people on this stupid pirate ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.15,0:19:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm still upset with\Nyou about the raw ham melon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.39,0:19:41.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is it Nami here? Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.57,0:19:43.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen her anywhere\Nsince this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.91,0:19:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.82,0:19:46.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,100 million berries?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.69,0:19:48.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She left all the money?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.51,0:19:52.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's not even gonna take some of\Nit, but she worked so hard to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.85,0:19:55.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'll steal more.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.55,0:19:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what her letter said.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.51,0:20:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, there's no changing her\Nmind once it's made up that girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.57,0:20:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She didn't even give us\Na chance to thank her
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.25,0:20:25.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.71,0:20:26.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is she running?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.77,0:20:28.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She said to set sail. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.23,0:20:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, she's planning on leaving us without\Nletting any of us thank her or say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.63,0:20:36.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.41,0:20:37.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sit still!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.05,0:20:44.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait! Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.19,0:20:46.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're leaving! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.01,0:20:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least let us say goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.67,0:20:51.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.13,0:20:53.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let us thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.83,0:20:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.74,0:20:57.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.66,0:20:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't leave this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.25,0:21:01.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you sure you want to\Nlet her leave like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.59,0:21:03.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not my decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.39,0:21:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She does what she wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.61,0:21:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.89,0:21:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.65,0:21:57.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.17,0:21:58.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's my money?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.39,0:22:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My wallet's gone! Mine, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.51,0:22:01.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She stole my money!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.11,0:22:03.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My purse is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.25,0:22:09.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch! Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.39,0:22:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it a little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.81,0:22:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.73,0:22:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She hasn't changed a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.81,0:22:19.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd watch my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.77,0:22:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You lousy pickpockets!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.27,0:22:27.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll miss you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.69,0:22:39.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember what I told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.93,0:22:44.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.25,0:22:45.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.57,0:22:47.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll miss you. Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.71,0:22:51.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe her!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.45,0:22:55.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My little sister Got us good with that one
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.37,0:22:57.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be safe Nami
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.83,0:23:03.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.47,0:23:04.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it, doc?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.03,0:23:06.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami's bill!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.19,0:23:08.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.45,0:23:10.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That girl will never change.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.41,0:23:11.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's her new tattoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.07,0:23:13.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.07,0:23:16.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A tangerine and a pinwheel
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.01,0:23:21.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Genzo, where's your pinwheel?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.27,0:23:28.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.21,0:23:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm off.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.83,0:23:50.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Genzo, back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.51,0:23:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get so close to Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.19,0:23:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to see her smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.13,0:23:56.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your face is too scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.21,0:23:58.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's making her cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.11,0:24:01.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't change my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.71,0:24:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.71,0:24:05.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep this on my hat to distract her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.75,0:24:07.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think, little girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.19,0:24:09.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're joking, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.73,0:24:11.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a stupid pinwheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.43,0:24:13.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way it's going to make her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.35,0:24:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.25,0:24:22.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.45,0:24:48.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll say goodbye and squeeze your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.93,0:24:51.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll say, say I'm alone, but I'll waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.89,0:24:53.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm gonna keep you near.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.89,0:24:58.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I drift away, I pray you\Nwatch me as I disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.47,0:25:08.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I watch the sunrise, I begin to wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.53,0:25:13.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could be the reason\Nit's so hot inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.23,0:25:19.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No answer has come, but I can't\Nget away from what's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.37,0:25:21.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.69,0:25:29.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me how to catch those feelings,\Nget them to come back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.51,0:25:34.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do what I must because\Nthey're everything I want will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.57,0:25:39.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wrap these arms around my dreams\Nand pull them back from yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.15,0:25:44.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm holding hands with you,\NI'm sure that we can make a way.

